Complete local Rust example; the app itself does not execute it:
```rust
use std::path::Path;

fn main() {
    let path = Path::new("notes").join("today.txt");
    let name = path.file_name().and_then(|part| part.to_str()).unwrap_or("not text");
    println!("{name}");
}
```

